<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR1d0052-en-d45ae395" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>禮記 英譯</title><editor role="translator">Luo Zhiye 羅志野</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>禮記 英譯</title>南京：南京大學出版社，2017</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR1d0052"><title xml:lang="och">禮記(正文)</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-05-06T00:17:04.676+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR1d0052-start"><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.3-h" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:18:05.017+09:00">The Golden Mean</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:18:15.21+09:00">1. What is given to the people by heaven is called nature. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:19:09.071+09:00">Anyone that follows thenature is called the road.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:19:19.729+09:00">The way how to repair and renovate the road is calledinstruction. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:22:44.928+09:00">The road</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:22:50.837+09:00">may not be left by the people for a minute.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:23:00.685+09:00">If it is left, it wouldnot be called the road. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:23:07.078+09:00">So the junzi should be cautious in the place where others couldnot see,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:23:12.005+09:00"> and careful and precise in the place where others could not hear. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:23:45.376+09:00">The mostsecret thing or the smallest thing </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:23:42.317+09:00">This tells that a junzi should becautious when he is alone. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:24:08.987+09:00">will be visible or found. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:24:59.85+09:00">When the feelings such as pleasure, anger, sorrow or joy arenot shown</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:25:24.358+09:00">it is called the ordinary state. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:35:58.885+09:00">When those feelings have been shown and in accordance with the ordinary degree,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:26:08.737+09:00">it is called the harmonious state.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:26:20.53+09:00">The ordinarystate is the common nature of all things under heaven, </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:26:26.921+09:00">and the harmonious state is theroad that leads all things to their directions in the world.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:26:36.445+09:00">When the ordinary state ismingled with the harmonious state,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:27:21.936+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:27:34.756+09:00">it arrives at the most perfect degree, </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:27:45.599+09:00">and then allthings in the universe </seg><seg corresp="#KR1d0052_tls_032-2a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-06T00:28:48.729+09:00">may be enriched and flourish naturally.</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>